# Template Mining for Information Extraction from Digital Documents.

**Authors:** Chowdhury, Gobinda G.

## Abstract
Reviews template mining research and shows how templates are used in World Wide Web search engines and metasearch engines for helping end-users generate natural language search expressions. Potential areas of application of template mining for extraction of information from digital documents are highlighted, and how such applications are used is indicated. Contains 60 references. (MES)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ595489

